  "title": "Aevex Corp (AVEX): Strong first quarter after IPO; Buy",
  "type": "equity_research",
  "priority": "medium",
  "published": "2026-05-21",
  "insights": [
   "AVEX delivered strong 1Q26 results in its first reported quarter since IPO, with revenue, EBITDA, and free cash flow all beating consensus.",
   "Management provided 2026 guidance for revenue ($600-$620mn) and adjusted EBITDA ($88.0-$94.5mn) that sits above consensus estimates.",
   "Revenue growth is being driven by UAS (Unmanned Aerial Systems) production volume, with 1Q26 revenue 4X the year-ago period.",
   "The company expects to convert ~93% of its $356.6mn funded backlog into revenue during the remainder of 2026.",
   "Goldman raised the 12-month price target to $35 from $34, citing updated revenue and margin estimates."
